<section class="page-intro shell"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR BAG</span><h1>আপনার ব্যাগ।~</h1><p>বাছাই করা পণ্য ও পরিমাণ যাচাই করুন।</p></section><section class="section shell cart-layout"><?php if(($data['cart']??[])===[]): ?><div class="empty-state cart-empty"><span class="empty-mark" aria-hidden="true">A</span><h2>ব্যাগ এখনো খালি।</h2><p>পছন্দের কিছু খুঁজে নিন, তারপর এখানে ফিরে আসুন।</p><a class="button button-green" href="/shop">দোকান ঘুরে দেখুন</a></div><?php else: ?><div><form action="/cart/update" method="post"><?= csrf_field() ?><div class="cart-list"><?php foreach($data['cart'] as $item): ?><article class="cart-item"><a class="cart-thumb" href="/product/<?= rawurlencode((string)$item['slug']) ?>"><img src="<?= e($item['image_url']?:asset('category-tech.jpg')) ?>" alt="<?= e($item['name']) ?>"></a><div class="cart-item-info"><h2><a href="/product/<?= rawurlencode((string)$item['slug']) ?>"><?= e($item['name']) ?></a></h2><span><?= e(format_price((float)$item['price'],$item['currency']??null)) ?> each · <?= (int)$item['stock_quantity'] ?> available</span><label for="qty-<?= e($item['id']) ?>">পরিমাণ <span class="muted">(০ দিলে সরানো হবে)</span></label><input id="qty-<?= e($item['id']) ?>" type="number" name="quantity[<?= e($item['id']) ?>]" value="<?= (int)$item['quantity'] ?>" min="0" max="<?= min(20,(int)$item['stock_quantity']) ?>"></div><div class="cart-line-actions"><strong class="line-price"><?= e(format_price((float)$item['line_total'],$item['currency']??null)) ?></strong><button class="text-link" type="submit" form="remove-<?= e($item['id']) ?>">সরান</button></div></article><?php endforeach; ?></div><button class="button button-outline update-cart" type="submit">কার্ট আপডেট করুন</button></form><?php foreach($data['cart'] as $item): ?><form id="remove-<?= e($item['id']) ?>" action="/cart/remove" method="post" class="sr-only"><?= csrf_field() ?><input type="hidden" name="product_id" value="<?= e($item['id']) ?>"></form><?php endforeach; ?></div><aside class="cart-summary"><span class="eyebrow">ORDER SUMMARY</span><h2>অর্ডারের সারাংশ</h2><div><span>Subtotal</span><strong><?= e(format_price((float)$data['subtotal'])) ?></strong></div><p>Shipping, coupon ও tax checkout-এ যাচাই হবে। বর্তমান payment পদ্ধতি: Cash on Delivery।</p><a class="button button-green button-full" href="/checkout">Checkout এগিয়ে যান <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/shop">আরও কেনাকাটা করুন</a></aside><?php endif; ?></section>
